# Merge into .github/CODEOWNERS and turn on "Require review from Code Owners" for the protected branch.
# These files are the judge: a pull request runs its own copy of the workflow, so a change to any of them needs a
# human before the checks it produces can be trusted. Replace the team with the people who own verification.
/.github/workflows/vgate.yml  @your-org/verification-owners
/.github/CODEOWNERS           @your-org/verification-owners
/vgate.yaml                   @your-org/verification-owners
**/known-failures.yaml        @your-org/verification-owners
